{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018pzLEAtsLksDYdV2UosdyA","type":"tool_result","content":"README.md\ngen.py\nnotes/badges-for-your-users-achievements.md\nnotes/collecting-leads-with-apps-script.md\nnotes/exact-hr-corridors-on-garmin-from-intervals-icu-api-workouts.md\nplans/tempo-run.json\npush.sh\nreadback/event-184233-as-sent.json\nreadback/watch-notes.md\n# What the watch showed for event 184233 (Tempo run 45)\n\nIntervals: LTHR 172. Watch (Forerunner 965): auto-detected LTHR 168, zones\nZ1 <118, Z2 118–137, Z3 137–151, Z4 151–162, Z5 >162.\n\n`GET /api/v1/athlete/{id}/events/184233` returned the event exactly as we sent\nit (see `event-184233-as-sent.json`); `workout_doc.steps` is populated, so the\nAPI accepted it.\n\n| step | planned (% LTHR) | expected on watch (× 172) | watch displayed |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Warm-up easy | 68–75 | 117–129 | 118–137 |\n| Tempo | 88–93 | 151–160 | 151–162 |\n| Float | 75–82 | 129–141 | 137–151 |\n| Cool-down | 65–72 | 112–124 | 118–137 |\n\nEvery corridor shows up as one of the watch's own zone bands, not the range we\nplanned. Changing the watch's LTHR to 172 moves the bands but they are still\nzone edges, never 151–160 or 129–141. Earlier tries: `units: \"bpm\"` with\nabsolute values made the watch show 214–249 bpm; `start_bpm`/`end_bpm` made\nevery target a constant 101.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98aca3fc-61e6-48a0-92b0-1556e6e9f2a0","uuid":"57b4d171-c117-42fa-8c58-8a82e3dba014","timestamp":"2026-10-19T03:11:18.850Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"README.md\ngen.py\nnotes/badges-for-your-users-achievements.md\nnotes/collecting-leads-with-apps-script.md\nnotes/exact-hr-corridors-on-garmin-from-intervals-icu-api-workouts.md\nplans/tempo-run.json\npush.sh\nreadback/event-184233-as-sent.json\nreadback/watch-notes.md\n# What the watch showed for event 184233 (Tempo run 45)\n\nIntervals: LTHR 172. Watch (Forerunner 965): auto-detected LTHR 168, zones\nZ1 <118, Z2 118–137, Z3 137–151, Z4 151–162, Z5 >162.\n\n`GET /api/v1/athlete/{id}/events/184233` returned the event exactly as we sent\nit (see `event-184233-as-sent.json`); `workout_doc.steps` is populated, so the\nAPI accepted it.\n\n| step | planned (% LTHR) | expected on watch (× 172) | watch displayed |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Warm-up easy | 68–75 | 117–129 | 118–137 |\n| Tempo | 88–93 | 151–160 | 151–162 |\n| Float | 75–82 | 129–141 | 137–151 |\n| Cool-down | 65–72 | 112–124 | 118–137 |\n\nEvery corridor shows up as one of the watch's own zone bands, not the range we\nplanned. Changing the watch's LTHR to 172 moves the bands but they are still\nzone edges, never 151–160 or 129–141. Earlier tries: `units: \"bpm\"` with\nabsolute values made the watch show 214–249 bpm; `start_bpm`/`end_bpm` made\nevery target a constant 101.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018pzLEAtsLksDYdV2UosdyA","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
